From 4ec4d57d9ab0a0cef99d00da41f7a7c20974aeaa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shubh <shubhaggarwalva@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 12:51:49 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] JusBrowse: keep only release logo SVG+PNG, remove all Firefox
 logos
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Keep only src/main/res/drawable/ic_launcher_foreground.xml (8-circle SVG)
  and src/main/res/mipmap-xxxhdpi/ic_launcher.png (14KB PNG white bg) as
  the two release logos; delete all other ic_wordmark, ic_logo_wordmark,
  ic_firefox, expressive_firefox, fenix_error, fenix_search_widget,
  ic_launcher alternative foregrounds/backgrounds and variant mipmap
  PNGs (beta/nightly/release/debug) – 171 files, ponytail deletion.
- AppIcon.kt: keep only AppDefault (JusBrowse), remove 22 alternatives
- styles.xml: fenixLogo/WordmarkLogo/Text -> ic_launcher_foreground
  for both Normal/Private themes (covers debug+release)
